WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.375
It's not going to be same here without you, Bridgewater

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:05.166
We'll be watching when Forbath pulls a Walsh
in the Wild Card

00:00:05.166 --> 00:00:06.833
See you on the field soon, Teddy

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:09.416
Andrew, nobody has any idea what's wrong with you

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:11.125
or if you'll even play again

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:11.750
That's ok

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.958
Dear fellas

00:00:17.958 --> 00:00:21.125
I can't believe how fast things move on the outside

00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:22.751
Hey, watch it old-timer!

00:00:22.751 --> 00:00:26.735
Seems like the world went and got itself
in one big hurry-up offense

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:30.287
I saw a touchdown celebration once when I was a kid

00:00:30.287 --> 00:00:32.577
But now, they're everywhere

00:00:32.577 --> 00:00:34.675
I was 22 then

00:00:34.675 --> 00:00:36.986
I'm 24 now

00:00:36.986 --> 00:00:41.708
I remember when Los Angeles was just a
place teams threatened to move to

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.868
Now, they got a team and a half

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:46.391
And nobody seems to care

00:00:46.391 --> 00:00:52.196
Somedays I think I should just take a cheap shot
from Fletcher Cox, so they'll send me home to the IR

00:00:52.196 --> 00:00:55.454
But just when I thought the league had passed me by

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:57.416
I realized

00:00:57.416 --> 00:01:00.034
Some things never change

